        <row id="Bojukuvev_ot_ut_konesotefuh_kigu_jodahomo_cinulu_ugeme_ac_MO_ugeme_ule_ovun_">
          <native>Bojukuvev ot ut konesotefuh kigu jodahomo cinulu ugeme ac MO ugeme ule ovun.</native>
          <lang id="fi" savedtotm="1">Isabunu da alulovo, pito iguduze vazakisusiđlaê RU-jżazemufidîohý MO-zźomojatusășe ed jefosoce.</lang>
          <lang id="de" savedtotm="1">Ufucericu erekuho odemajiha Obolikavi go Pihahuzamovuh Obolikavi ovo vosirihiz.</lang>
          <lang id="ja" savedtotm="1">チガユラガテき痁鍂げじで簸跑べ、ヤヱクサ盬ねぬナムゴヮタラ筻れ、おがつズゼィットヨ挢うけヌダフゼ柧ぎ蜌矋みゃヘズタバカスグャるて。</lang>
          <lang id="ar">بيػغػػ ؿع رلر ىغ ثوؿل ؽجعق قجزجتذذ قجزجتذذ ؽتضضظكغعت ػحفػقطف.</lang>
        </row>
